      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400138.png",
      "text": "Waxaan jeclahay inaan ciyaaro kubadda cagta. Waxaan jeclahay inaan kubadda cagta la ciyaaro Thando, Nhlanhla iyo Ben.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8fcf5fe7a0a1d9c91e4102952d467499501d532d44cb478676da7b6a7b6d638c"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400140.png",
      "text": "Tani waa hooyaday. Waxaan jeclahay hooyadey. Wey iga qoslisaa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:157f4b08493a336af096acbca7068df3d5bc71d8fba3c05837f2f41162aba875"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400141.png",
      "text": "Waxaan jeclahay Ilaahay, maxaa yeelay Ilaahay baa i abuuray.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:443258c0ebb84f2971bdda0905d6a1f83173860196261a20a6e1df6b5fde2f77"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400142.png",
      "text": "Waxaan jeclahay dugsiga, maxaa yeelay macallimiintu waxay i baraan waxa aan u baahanahay inaan ogaado.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:38f87fbeb9357c04819d6741309523ec105ef2a941f3014f972c0f39ab55529a"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400139.png",
      "text": "Waxaan jeclahay inaan eeyaha la ciyaaro, maxaa yeelay waa madadaalo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6e2e1619208f794fb5ab3489fc9c7c290eece0df562605664b0ded3af0e19c77"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400143.png",
      "text": "Waxaan jeclahay maalmaha dhalashada, maxaa yeelay waxaan jeclahay inaan dabaaldego.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:6f90305d2410099b2c5e35ce96dd263528df3408d78ecf98a58c9cf4ee7c77aa"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400144.png",
      "text": "Anigana waan jeclahay naftayda maxaa yeelay…",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:c06c5672b6574b46624e41218d60e757d87914118ffa62bfb44c20afcab35ad8"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/91400145.png",
      "text": "… maxaa yeelay … waan sameeyaa!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=52487#page=8",
